# Review queues and gold sets embed full document text — keep real
# citizen documents out of version control. The label store itself
# (data/labels/labels.jsonl) holds decisions and file references only,
# and is safe to commit if your policy allows it.
data/labels/queue*.jsonl
data/gold/

# Few-shot example sets embed (redacted) document text and are sent to the
# API on every request. Built locally from your own gold labels; not shared.
data/prompt/

# Coverage artifacts
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
runs/
